{
 "_comment": "tiny-chat recursion arm, Stage 0 (experiments/tiny_chat_2026-10/PREREGISTRATION.md amendment 3, A3.3): the CUDA gate, a 300-step probe per cell (20m_R2, 20m_R4, 20m_R8, 20m_MC7), then the screens of 20m_R2, 20m_R4, 20m_MC7 (R8's wait for the R8 rule); screens at [0.00025, 0.0005, 0.001, 0.002] x 1500 steps, seed 101, on the 35% mix. One GPU job at a time. The gate needs the floor pilot's PASS; probes and screens need the CUDA gate passed on their VM. Estimated 8.4 L4 VM-hours (probes scaled from 20m_L4's by FLOPs per token until the arm's own come home). Afterwards, at home: copy ART/cuda_gate/cuda_gate.json to experiments/tiny_chat_2026-10/recursion/cuda_gate.json and the probe folders to experiments/tiny_chat_2026-10/stage0/rec/, then python tools/colab_chat/tiny_chat_run.py choose_rec --art ART --out experiments/tiny_chat_2026-10/stage0/lr_choice_rec.json, commit, rerun make_jobs.py. Upload vocab_llama3_bpe.gguf with the runner's --upload. Dialogue levels [0, 17, 35, 70]% (copies), E1 at 35% (design.json final).",
 "max_parallel": 1,
